<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Home Federal started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Home Federal started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Hilliard Lyons said Thursday it had initiated coverage of Home Federal Bancorp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst Alan Morel in a report said he believes Indiana-based Home Federal is undervalued and is in a position to show improving, sustainable profitability.</p>
<p>-- Home Federal was unchanged at 27-3/4.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
